1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,760
The Moon is running away from us.

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,919
Every year, it drifts 1.5 inches farther away.

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,179
That's about as fast as your fingernails grow.

4
00:00:07,628 --> 00:00:10,199
When it was born, it was so close it filled the sky,

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,539
And a day on Earth lasted about 6 hours.

6
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:16,780
In 600 million years, it'll be too far to cover the Sun.

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,399
And it's still leaving. Right now,
